##POST 这个不是对应本人中国北京的API-Key。https://llm-123456.ap-southeast-1.maas.aliyuncs.com/api/v1/services/aigc/text2image/image-synthesis
POST https://llm-123456.cn-beijing.maas.aliyuncs.com/api/v1/services/aigc/multimodal-generation/generation
Authorization: Bearer sk-********************************
Content-Type: application/json;charset=UTF-8
X-DashScope-Async: enable
{
  "model":"wan2.6-t2i",
  "input": {
  "messages":[
  {
    "role":"user", 
    "content": [
                    {
                        "text": "一间有着精致窗户的花店，漂亮的木质门，摆放着花朵"
                    }
     ]
  }
]
  },
  "parameters": {
        "prompt_extend": false,
        "watermark": true,
        "n": 1,
        "negative_prompt": "低分辨率，低画质，肢体畸形，手指畸形，画面过饱和，蜡像感，人脸无细节，过度光滑，画面具有AI感。构图混乱。文字模糊，扭曲。Low resolution, low image quality, distorted limbs, deformed fingers, oversaturated colors, waxy look, faces lacking detail, overly smooth, AI-like appearance. Chaotic composition. Blurry, distorted text.", 
        "size": "1280*1280" 
    }
}
